<title>NETHERLANDS: BOLSWESSANEN UNIT BUYS US FIRM.</title>
<headline>BOLSWESSANEN UNIT BUYS US FIRM.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch food and drinks group BolsWessanen NV said on Tuesday its eastern dairy division in the U.S. was acquiring U.S. Dean Foods unit Ready Foods.</p>
<p>Crowley Foods Inc., the eastern dairy division in the United States, has reached agreement to acquire Ready Foods Inc. of Philadelphia, a wholly-owned subsidiary of Dean Foods, BolsWessanen said in a statement.</p>
<p>Ready Foods generates $25 million of sales and employs 85 staff.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
